            "review_title": "Review at Paderborner Outlet",
            "review_text": "Zoe1750\nAuckland Central, New Zealand5 contributions\n1\nMost delicious beer in Da nang\nAug 2022 • Couples\nFound this cute beer place in the middle of the city. Very convenient and close to my hotel. \nI was surprised to find this beer spot but even more surprised to see they specialises in imported German beer and also some French wines. \nThe beer is super delicious, staff are friendly and have a nice outdoor seating to relax and watch the world go by. \nCan recommend and will be visiting every time I return to Da Nang.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 31, 2022",
